    "source_book_raw": "Distant Realms pg. 33",
    "definition_raw": "Source Distant Realms pg. 33\nYour thrown weapons shine with a divine light that dazzles their targets.\n\nPrerequisites: Point-Blank Shot, good or lawful alignment, caster level 1st or monk level 1st.\n\nBenefit: Your thrown weapons glow with holy light, illuminating a 20-foot-radius area where they fall for 1 round. A target damaged by one of these weapons becomes dazzled for 1 round.",
